    {
      "paper_id": "doi:10.1016/j.jfineco.2023.01.005",
      "sequence": 2,
      "source_sequence": 2,
      "article_type": "research-article",
      "title_en": "The global factor structure of exchange rates",
      "title_cn": "汇率的全球因子结构",
      "authors": [
        "Sofonias Alemu Korsaye",
        "Fabio Trojani",
        "Andrea Vedolin"
      ],
      "abstract_en": "We propose a model-free methodology to estimate international stochastic discount factors (SDFs) that jointly price cross-sections of international stocks, bonds, and currencies in markets with frictions. We theoretically establish a SDF decomposition into one global factor and a currency basket. We show that our global factor prices a large cross-section of international asset returns, not just in- but also out-of-sample, across different currency denominations. Moreover, the pricing ability of the global factor is largely independent of the market structure or the size and type of market friction.",
      "abstract_cn": "我们提出了一种无模型方法，用于估计国际随机贴现因子（SDFs），这些因子在存在摩擦的市场中共同为国际股票、债券和货币的横截面定价。我们在理论上建立了SDF分解为一个全球因子和一个货币篮子。我们表明，我们的全球因子为国际资产收益的大横截面定价，不仅在样本内，而且在样本外，跨不同货币计价。此外，全球因子的定价能力在很大程度上独立于市场结构或市场摩擦的大小和类型。",
      "doi": "10.1016/j.jfineco.2023.01.005",
      "source_url": "https://ideas.repec.org/a/eee/jfinec/v148y2023i1p21-46.html",
